  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/309) by Sebastien Guyader (Bitbucket: [Sebastien Guyader](https://bitbucket.org/Sebastien Guyader), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nWhen I enable `Sigmoid tone mapper` in `Film simulation`, close ART and try to load it again, ART crashes \\(crash report and files available [here](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jThH1sH94ExiMDdmo25VotFvwTWVEfSl?usp=sharing)\\). The crash is not systematic with only `Sigmoid tone mapper` enabled but seems exacerbated and almost systematic by enabling a CTL script in \\`Color/Tone correction\\`. Deleting the .arp profile of the image that was being edited or the corresponding image cache data in `.cache/ART/data` allows ART to start up again.\n\n‌\n",
